msgid ":ref:`Server Actions <reference/actions/server>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Server Actions <reference/actions/server>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/ai/server-actions.rst:127
msgid "Common issues"
msgstr "ปัญหาที่พบบ่อย"

