#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:3
msgid "Call queues"
msgstr "คิวการโทร"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:5
msgid ""
"A call queue organizes and routes incoming calls when all agents are busy, "
"placing callers on hold in the order they called. This system helps manage "
"high call volumes more efficiently, ensures fair workload distribution, and "
"provides a more predictable experience for both callers and agents."
msgstr ""
"Fronta hovorů organizuje a směruje příchozí hovory, když jsou všichni agenti "
"zaneprázdněni, a umísťuje volající do fronty v pořadí, v jakém volali. Tento "
"systém pomáhá efektivněji spravovat velké objemy hovorů, zajišťuje "
"spravedlivé rozdělení pracovní zátěže a poskytuje předvídatelnější zkušenost "
"pro volající i agenty."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:9
msgid ""
"This document explains how to configure call queue settings and log into a "
"queue from the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Tento dokument vysvětluje, jak nakonfigurovat nastavení fronty hovorů a "
"přihlásit se do fronty z databáze Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Set up on hold music <voip/axivox/music_on_hold>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Nastavení hudby při čekání <voip/axivox/music_on_hold>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:16
msgid "Add a queue"
msgstr "Přidání fronty"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:18
msgid ""
"To add a call queue in Axivox, navigate to the `Axivox management console "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_. In the left menu, click :guilabel:`Queues`. "
"Next, click :guilabel:`Add a queue`. From here, set up the call queue."
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li přidat frontu hovorů v Axivox, přejděte do `konzole správy Axivox "
"<https://manage.axivox.com>`_. V levé nabídce klikněte "
"na :guilabel:`Queues`. Dále klikněte na :guilabel:`Add a queue`. Zde "
"nastavte frontu hovorů."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:22
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: The call queue's name. A required field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Name`: Název fronty hovorů. Povinné pole."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Internal Extension`: The extension agents can transfer callers "
"to. A required field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Internal Extension`: Linka, na kterou mohou agenti přepojit "
"volající. Povinné pole."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Strategy`: How calls are routed. Choose the option that best "
"matches the company's needs for this call queue:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Strategy`: Způsob směrování hovorů. Vyberte možnost, která "
"nejlépe odpovídá potřebám společnosti pro tuto frontu hovorů:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:27
msgid ":guilabel:`Call all available agents`: The call is sent to every agent."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Call all available agents`: Hovor je odeslán všem agentům."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Calls the agent who has received the call for the longest time`: "
"The call is sent to the agent with the longest idle time."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Calls the agent who has received the call for the longest time`: "
"Hovor je odeslán agentovi s nejdelším časem nečinnosti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Calls the agent who has received the least call`: The call is "
"sent to the agent who has handled the fewest calls in a time window."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Calls the agent who has received the least call`: Hovor je "
"odeslán agentovi, který zpracoval nejméně hovorů v časovém okně."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:32
msgid ":guilabel:`Call a random agent`: The call is sent to a random agent."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Call a random agent`: Hovor je odeslán náhodnému agentovi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Call agents one after the other`: The call is sent to the next "
"agent in a specified order. This order is remembered, and the order does not "
"reset after each call."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Call agents one after the other`: Hovor je odeslán dalšímu "
"agentovi v určeném pořadí. Toto pořadí je zapamatováno a neresetuje se po "
"každém hovoru."

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Call agents one after the other starting with the first in the "
"list`: The call is sent to the next agent in a specified order. This order "
"is remembered, and the order does reset after each call."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Call agents one after the other starting with the first in the "
"list`: การโทรจะถูกส่งไปยังเอเจนต์ถัดไปตามลำดับที่กำหนด "
"ลำดับนี้จะถูกจดจำและลำดับจะไม่รีเซ็ตหลังจากการโทรแต่ละครั้ง"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Maximum waiting time in seconds`: How long a customer can wait in "
"the queue before getting forwarded to voicemail or a specific agent."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maximum waiting time in seconds`: "
"ระยะเวลาที่ลูกค้าสามารถรอในคิวก่อนที่จะถูกส่งต่อไปยังกล่องข้อความเสียงหรือเอเจนต์เฉพาะ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Maximum duration of ringing at an agent`: How long an individual "
"agent's phone rings before the call gets moved onto the next step in the "
"dial plan. Learn more about :doc:`dial plans <dial_plan_basics>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maximum duration of ringing at an agent`: "
"ระยะเวลาที่โทรศัพท์ของตัวแทนแต่ละคนดังก่อนที่สายจะถูกย้ายไปยังขั้นตอนถัดไปในแผนการโทร "
"เรียนรู้เพิ่มเติมเกี่ยวกับ:doc:`dial plans <dial_plan_basics>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Static agents`: Agents in the queue who receive calls without "
"logging in."
msgstr ":guilabel:`ตัวแทนคงที่`: ตัวแทนในคิวที่รับสายโดยไม่ต้องเข้าสู่ระบบ"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/phone/axivox/call_queues.rst:45
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dynamic agents`: Agents who must log into the queue to receive "
"calls from it."
msgstr ":guilabel:`ตัวแทนแบบไดนามิก`: ตัวแทนที่ต้องเข้าสู่ระบบในคิวเพื่อรับสายจากคิวนั้น"

