#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:109
msgid ":doc:`In-App Purchase (IAP) <../../essentials/in_app_purchase>`"
msgstr ":doc:`การซื้อในแอป (IAP) <../../essentials/in_app_purchase>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/sign/security_authentication.rst:110
msgid ""
":doc:`SMS pricing and FAQ <../../marketing/sms_marketing/pricing_and_faq>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`ราคา SMS และคำถามที่พบบ่อย <../../marketing/sms_marketing/"
