msgstr "กำหนดจำนวนแถว/บันทึกที่แสดง"

#: ../../export/content/applications/productivity/spreadsheet/insert/insert_list.rst:428
msgid ""
"By default, when an Odoo list is inserted directly from a spreadsheet or "
